cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "insurance-conformal"
abstract: >
  Distribution-free prediction intervals for insurance pricing models. Implements
  split conformal prediction with insurance-specific non-conformity scores
  (Pearson-weighted for Tweedie/Poisson models), locally weighted conformal
  prediction, Conformal Risk Control for premium sufficiency, frequency-severity
  conformal prediction, and online conformal inference with retrospective
  adjustment (RetroAdj) for claims inflation adaptation.
authors:
  - name: "Burning Cost Contributors"
